  data: {
    LLM: "Save your 'Honors' (2♥, 4♣, etc.) to capture opponent High Cards. Don't waste your Sevens; they are your absolute weapons for leading when you are sure to win.\n\nIf you have a terrible hand, use the 'Friðufær' rule to swap with the stock—it's often better than playing dead cards.\n\nCoordinate with your partner's high card (shown at start). If your partner has the K♦, play defensively to let them win the lead, then protect their leads with rubbish.",
    Player: "Save your 'Honors' (2♥, 4♣, etc.) to capture opponent High Cards. Don't waste your Sevens; they are your absolute weapons for leading when you are sure to win.\n\nIf you have a terrible hand, use the 'Friðufær' rule to swap with the stock—it's often better than playing dead cards.\n\nCoordinate with your partner's high card (shown at start). If your partner has the K♦, play defensively to let them win the lead, then protect their leads with rubbish.",
